# thor-soar
#
# The Thor-Soar kitchen agent for AI2-THOR: its operators (go-to, pick up/put, open/close, cook, clean, slice 
# ...), scene and anchor memory handling, exploration and room scanning, Thor vocabulary and Thor-specific 
# settings (epmem, svs, rl, chunking). Needs the external environment; cannot be run stand-alone.
#
# Requires: soar-base, selection-world, agent-world, object-world.
# Loaded by: thor.soar
#
# Contents (rules per file)
#     65  Anchoring objects from memory and the scene (epmem/smem retrieval, existing objects, object and relation classes): anchor-epmem-retrieve, anchor-info-existing-object, anchor-object-class, anchor-relation-class, anchor-smem-in-retrieve, anchor-smem-object-retrieve
#     46  Scene creation and update, scene semantic memory, svs extraction: init-scene-smem, scene-creation, scene-update, search-smem, smem-copy-retrieved-in, smem-copy-retrieved-object, svs-extract-distance, svs-extract, update-scene-smem-object-visible
#     76  Exploration, room scanning and searching: explore-clean-up-lost-object, explore-clean-up-undo, explore-finished, explore-go-to-incomplete-category, explore-goto-untested-category, explore-in-receptacle-finished, explore-in-receptacle-object, explore-new-class, explore-receptacles, explore-test-action-complete, explore-test-action-success-undo, explore-test-action, scan-room, search-closed-receptacles, visit-all-objects
#     44  Movement and perception operators: drive, go-to, look-at, look, turn, look-at, turn-180, turn-270, turn-360, turn-90
#    140  Object manipulation operators (open/close, put in/on, cook, clean, slice, fill, break ...): break-object, clean-counters, clean-dishwasher, clean-object, close-container, cook-microwave, cook-stove, dirty-object, discard, egg-cooked-microwave-plated, empty-object, fill-object, finish-broken-egg, get-object, make-coffee, open-container, put-in, put-on, slice-object, store, toast, turn-off, turn-on-microwave, turn-on, clean-surface, clean-up-topstate
#     46  Task and desired handling, initialization, cleanup: create-object-state-desired, find-object, initialize-thor-soar, next-desireds, remove-destroyed-object, remove-unanchored-object-visible, report-task-complete
#      6  Thor external action application and action times: external-operator-application
#    222  elaborations/: Thor state vocabulary (properties such as accessible, reachable, holding), achieved-desireds, search control, flags initialization, svs, world-from-scene
#     11  Impasse__Operator_Tie/: Thor tie handling and constraint-failure detection
#     22  from-agent-world/: rules moved out of agent-world because they mention Thor vocabulary (to be reviewed)
#      7  other: clean-dishwasher/elaborations.soar, find-object/clear-searched-hidden.soar, find-object/clear-searched.soar
#
# _firstload.soar sources ../../agent/thor-soar-semantic-memory.soar, which is not part of this tree (as before).
# Thor-specific flags and architecture settings live in _flags/ (epmem, svs, rl, chunking, decay).
